 5697	6000					    ; File: components.asm
 5698	6000					        ; Description: Component systems based on Mideas React.js architecture
 5699	6000					    ; Implements Position, Sprite, Movement, Collision, Input, and Behavior systems
 5700	6000					    ; ==================================================================
 5701	6000					;
 5702	6000					; INTELLIGENT FILTERING ACTIVE:
 5703	6000					;   Active entities: 5
 5704	6000					;   Used components: Position, Sprite, Input, Cursors, Gravity, WallCollision, Animation, Jump, StateMachine, Collision, TileInteraction, Health, DeadlyTiles, Patrol
